{"id":"n22144-1-8","stage":2,"title":"옷차림 · 穿着","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22144-1-8-1","ko":"딸을 잃어버렸을 당시 딸의 옷차림은 어땠나요?","zh":"当时您丢失女儿的时候，她穿的是什么衣服呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"딸을","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잃어버렸을","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃어버리다：失去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"2","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당시","meaning":"当时，那时","explanation":"당시：当时，那时","readings":[{"term":"당시","audio":"/audio/53613ed0216550ac6d00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14259","senseId":"1","lemma":"당시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"딸의","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷차림은","meaning":"穿着，衣着，打扮","explanation":"옷차림：穿着，衣着，打扮；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"옷차림","audio":"/audio/e62aaa39b90c8025908d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22144","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷차림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠나요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"失去","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"与人断了联系或分离。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]},{"id":"53613ed0216550ac","term":"당시","zh":"当时，那时","audio":"/audio/53613ed0216550ac6d00.mp3","entryId":"14259","definition":"某事发生的那个时刻；或指前面所说的那个时刻。","pronunciation":["당시"]},{"id":"e62aaa39b90c8025","term":"옷차림","zh":"穿着，衣着，打扮","audio":"/audio/e62aaa39b90c8025908d.mp3","entryId":"22144","definition":"穿着衣服的样子。","pronunciation":["옫차림"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea84a5aa370a3b3d7b62.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22144-1-8-2","ko":"파란색 반바지에 흰색 티셔츠를 입고 있었어요.","zh":"她穿着蓝色短裤和白色T恤。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"파란색","meaning":"湛绿色，湛蓝色","explanation":"파란색：湛绿色，湛蓝色","readings":[{"term":"파란색","audio":"/audio/53ca6b594a240acca9a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71305","senseId":"1","lemma":"파란색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반바지에","meaning":"短裤","explanation":"반바지：短裤；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"반바지","audio":"/audio/437b0799c87be11479de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57585","senseId":"1","lemma":"반바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흰색","meaning":"白色","explanation":"흰색：白色","readings":[{"term":"흰색","audio":"/audio/a1e63f0c6f7b24bd41a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62883","senseId":"1","lemma":"흰색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"티셔츠를","meaning":"T恤","explanation":"티셔츠：T恤；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"티셔츠","audio":"/audio/f977ac4486c2b67cd296.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82674","senseId":"1","lemma":"티셔츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"53ca6b594a240acc","term":"파란색","zh":"湛绿色，湛蓝色","audio":"/audio/53ca6b594a240acca9a5.mp3","entryId":"71305","definition":"如晴朗的天空或大海一样明亮而鲜明的蓝色。","pronunciation":["파란색"]},{"id":"437b0799c87be114","term":"반바지","zh":"短裤","audio":"/audio/437b0799c87be11479de.mp3","entryId":"57585","definition":"长度到膝盖以上或膝盖的较短的裤子。","pronunciation":["반ː바지"]},{"id":"a1e63f0c6f7b24bd","term":"흰색","zh":"白色","audio":"/audio/a1e63f0c6f7b24bd41a4.mp3","entryId":"62883","definition":"和雪或牛奶一样的浅色。","pronunciation":["힌색"]},{"id":"f977ac4486c2b67c","term":"티셔츠","zh":"T恤","audio":"/audio/f977ac4486c2b67cd296.mp3","entryId":"82674","definition":"“T”字形的短袖衬衫。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b1da3ffd064a596ecd6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.495,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=22144","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2203,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["她穿着蓝色短裤和白色T恤。","当时您丢失女儿的时候，她穿的是什么衣服呢？","承奎，你身上烟味太重了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["当时您丢失女儿的时候，她穿的是什么衣服呢？","承奎，你身上烟味太重了。","她穿着蓝色短裤和白色T恤。"],"answer":2}]}
